Neovim Tutor: 05 BUFFERS & WINDOWS

Goal
  Move between files and splits efficiently.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Buffers
  :e {file}     open/edit file
  :ls           list buffers
  :b {num}      go to buffer
  :bd           close buffer

Practice:
  - Run :ls and switch to a buffer with :b.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: Windows (splits)
  :split      horizontal split
  :vsplit     vertical split
  <C-w>w      next window
  <C-w>h/j/k/l move between windows
  :q          close current window

Practice:
  - Create a split and move around with <C-w>.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 3: Tabs (optional)
  :tabnew     new tab
  :tabnext    next tab
  :tabclose   close tab

End of lesson 05.
